# Prettier does not read .gitignore, so anything git-ignored that Prettier would
# otherwise walk has to be repeated here. oxlint needs none of this — it honours
# .gitignore already.

# Markdown is deliberately not formatted. Ultracite's Prettier config sets
# `proseWrap: "never"`, which collapses every hand-wrapped paragraph — including the
# AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md your agents read — into one line each.
**/*.md

# Generated by pnpm, not hand-edited.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Saasaloy's own state, written by the CLI. `JSON.stringify(…, 2)` always expands
# arrays; Prettier would collapse the short ones and every `saasaloy add` would then
# leave `pnpm lint` red until you reformatted files you do not edit by hand.
saasaloy.json
saasaloy-lock.json
.saasaloy/

# Wrangler configs are patched surgically by `saasaloy add` (jsonc-parser rewrites only
# the touched region, so the comments Cloudflare configs rely on survive). Prettier
# wants trailing commas and collapsed short arrays in the inserted region, which the
# patcher does not emit — leaving `pnpm lint` red after every binding a module adds.
**/wrangler.jsonc

# Build output and dependencies.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.astro
**/.wrangler
